{"ID":"20240118151216-s6r78g4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151216-s6r78g4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151216-s6r78g4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151216-q4o3hus\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114427-4a9zfaf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122114427-4a9zfaf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:242,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:242\u0026#125;","title":"135鸡头实(芡实)","type":"doc","updated":"20240130162312"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151216-q4o3hus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151216-q4o3hus","updated":"20240122114403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘平，主湿痹，腰脊膝痛，补中，除暴疾，益精气强志，令耳目聪明，久服轻身，不饥耐老。今之芡实。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114407-oi4ar91","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114407-oi4ar91"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，产水泽中，俗名鸡头米。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114408-622xbpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114408-622xbpg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘淡，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114409-imav218","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114409-imav218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】芡实为固本益精要药，主泄泻遗精，带下白浊，治湿痹腰脊膝痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114411-mafpeld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114411-mafpeld"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】开胃助气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114414-z620tt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114414-z620tt9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】微甘而涩，能收湿气，故健脾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114417-q4a1y48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114417-q4a1y48"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】补脾益胃。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114418-8jw0ehs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114418-8jw0ehs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通二至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114419-40kbt72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114419-40kbt72"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】生食动冷气，小儿不宜多食，以难化也，故食芡必细嚼，使华液流通，转相灌输，其功胜于乳汁。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122114420-orhprld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114420-orhprld"}},{"ID":"20240122114420-2nuhlyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114420-2nuhlyo"}},{"ID":"20240122114420-y4xpxgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114420-y4xpxgs","updated":"20240130162148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那鸡头实呢，一三十五味，鸡头实就是我们的芡实，我们又有个名称称它为鸡头米。诸位看，这个一三十四味，这是蓬蘽，就是覆盆子长的这个样子，这个鸡头实就是我们芡实，长的这个样子，诸位可以传阅看一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240122114427-4a9zfaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122114427-4a9zfaf","updated":"20240130162312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个芡实呢，你看白色的一粒一粒的，长的象米一样米粒的。味甘淡，就是甘淡渗利的药，是属于阳药，我们可以平常都可以补中，平常都可以吃的，没事都可以拿来吃的，为固本益精要药。那腰膝酸痛，平常呢回家你可以煮些汤剂，象四陈汤啊你们可以煮啊，芡实就在这个地方，这是入《神农本草经》的，能够开胃助气。能收湿气，能够健脾。所以我们过去只要是健脾，要让脾胃功能很强，我们要靠甘淡渗利的药，象这些药都是甘淡渗利的药。剂量的话可以开2钱3钱都没有关系。这些药都是没有毒的，都是平常可以当饮食来吃的。这个是鸡头实。"}]}]}